    "sources": [
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-a78f835b9520c8b4c0c097ab",
        "path_or_url": "operations.md",
        "section": "Station operations",
        "snippet": "# Station operations\n\nThese procedures apply only to authenticated live station feeds in the active harbour.\n\nFor orientation, the operator console links to the dashboard's [display settings](dashboard.md#display).\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "6db577167b5502208e2c99261d233141110456df65c446e697cfb883ee3c2625",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 6,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/c1bbde629a89d599b9dba00f"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-86b2821d9fd40e95f5d9978f",
        "path_or_url": "operations.md",
        "section": "Station operations > Replay",
        "snippet": "## Replay\n\nTo replay an interrupted feed, pause the receiver and obtain a journal checkpoint before requesting the missing interval. Preserve the original observation identifiers during replay. Resume the receiver only after the exporter acknowledges the checkpoint. See the [retention rule](storage.md#retention) before removing journal files.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "853111989d7681e7591f64816ccef864252aaf621b8a2f2108e8058f596c96ce",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 7,
        "line_end": 10,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/b067497897fc475776f0f42a"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-3ef01a3af878517093c4aa91",
        "path_or_url": "operations.md",
        "section": "Station operations > Disconnected station",
        "snippet": "## Disconnected station\n\nIf a station is still disconnected, do not resume its receiver after replay; leave it paused until a fresh authenticated heartbeat arrives. This exception applies even when the exporter acknowledged the checkpoint.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "c0e97721f8b9188728de7d83d1f9f577826dd1ec8a036ccd524e1998d9868035",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 11,
        "line_end": 14,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/71d9e26a5be0e8d1e6b68528"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-ab4bbcbf860b74ebffd8ce8c",
        "path_or_url": "operations.md",
        "section": "Station operations > Survey imports",
        "snippet": "## Survey imports\n\nSurvey imports assign new identifiers and may start without a station heartbeat. They are scheduled offline and do not repair a live feed. Reusing this process for a station would create duplicate observations.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "c6f161de5b6f5a7e25120e64eed9a55ee45c3f5f309108b4303b7c206f93fddf",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 15,
        "line_end": 17,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/3bc1faa47dc78dbdc40b2351"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-0b2b3f18a1f9ad40e1662ab8",
        "path_or_url": "storage.md",
        "section": "Journal storage",
        "snippet": "# Journal storage\n\nJournal files contain original live observations. Exported bundles are derived products, not journal replacements until their checksums have been verified.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "da154d110d21c1208f174b6bb1579e0aa3d8d5a43f54f194c61d57d85d16fd91",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 4,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/347c3398f05eefe5fbf5dffa"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-90be8f75d97e3eb21d069164",
        "path_or_url": "storage.md",
        "section": "Journal storage > Retention",
        "snippet": "## Retention\n\nKeep a journal file for at least seven days and until the corresponding export checksum is verified. Both conditions must hold before deletion. A legal hold blocks deletion regardless of age or checksum status.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "94d184af056a286b51674ecfb24b7b3ce26dbe25531092413a0f800a55916146",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 8,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/88618195d80563d484342688"
      }
    ],
